{"seq":1,"slug":"custom-layout","title":"自定义布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/custom-layout","wordCount":633,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"自定义布局\">自定义布局</h1><p>Compose 的布局系统构建在一个清晰的协议之上：每个布局节点实现 <code>MeasurePolicy</code>，在约束（Constraints）内测量子节点并决定其摆放位置。当标准的 <code>Column</code>/<code>Row</code>/<code>Box</code> 无法满足产品设计时，<code>Layout</code> composable 让你以相同的协议从零实现任意复杂的排列逻辑——从瀑布流到环形菜单、从自适应标签到重叠卡片。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 布局遵循<strong>单次测量</strong>原则：每个子节点在一次布局过程中只能被测量一次（不像传统 Android View 系统允许多次 measure pass）。这一限制换来了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的布局复杂度保证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Layout Composable&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;MeasurePolicy.measure()&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;接收 Constraints&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;测量每个子节点 measurable.measure(constraints)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;获得 Placeable(含宽高)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;layout(width, height) { }&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;placeable.place(x, y)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Layout Composable\"] --&gt; B[\"MeasurePolicy.measure()\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"接收 Constraints\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"测量每个子节点 measurable.measure(constraints)\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"获得 Placeable(含宽高)\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"layout(width, height) { }\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"placeable.place(x, y)\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>关键方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Constraints</code></td>\n<td>父节点传递的宽高范围 (minW, maxW, minH, maxH)</td>\n<td>不可变数据类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Measurable</code></td>\n<td>待测量的子节点抽象</td>\n<td><code>measure(constraints): Placeable</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Placeable</code></td>\n<td>已测量完成的子节点，携带尺寸</td>\n<td><code>width</code>, <code>height</code>, <code>place(x, y)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MeasurePolicy</code></td>\n<td>布局算法的核心接口</td>\n<td><code>measure(measurables, constraints)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IntrinsicMeasurable</code></td>\n<td>提供固有尺寸信息的接口</td>\n<td><code>minIntrinsicWidth/Height</code>, <code>maxIntrinsicWidth/Height</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实现一个-flowrow-布局\">实现一个 FlowRow 布局</h2><p>FlowRow 是标签云等场景的典型布局：子项从左到右排列，空间不足时自动换行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun FlowRow(&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,&#10;    horizontalSpacing: Dp = 8.dp,&#10;    verticalSpacing: Dp = 8.dp,&#10;    content: @Composable () -&gt; Unit&#10;) {&#10;    Layout(&#10;        content = content,&#10;        modifier = modifier&#10;    ) { measurables, constraints -&gt;&#10;        val hSpacingPx = horizontalSpacing.roundToPx()&#10;        val vSpacingPx = verticalSpacing.roundToPx()&#10;&#10;        // 第一步：测量所有子节点（使用无限宽度约束，让子节点报告自然尺寸）&#10;        val placeables = measurables.map { measurable -&gt;&#10;            measurable.measure(Constraints(maxWidth = constraints.maxWidth))&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 第二步：计算行信息&#10;        var currentX = 0&#10;        var currentY = 0&#10;        var rowHeight = 0&#10;        val positions = mutableListOf&lt;Pair&lt;Int, Int&gt;&gt;()&#10;&#10;        placeables.forEach { placeable -&gt;&#10;            if (currentX + placeable.width &gt; constraints.maxWidth &amp;&amp; currentX &gt; 0) {&#10;                currentX = 0&#10;                currentY += rowHeight + vSpacingPx&#10;                rowHeight = 0&#10;            }&#10;            positions.add(currentX to currentY)&#10;            currentX += placeable.width + hSpacingPx&#10;            rowHeight = maxOf(rowHeight, placeable.height)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        val totalHeight = currentY + rowHeight&#10;&#10;        // 第三步：摆放&#10;        layout(constraints.maxWidth, totalHeight) {&#10;            placeables.forEachIndexed { index, placeable -&gt;&#10;                val (x, y) = positions[index]&#10;                placeable.place(x, y)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun FlowRow(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    horizontalSpacing: Dp = 8.dp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    verticalSpacing: Dp = 8.dp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    content: @Composable () -> Unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Layout(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        content = content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { measurables, constraints -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val hSpacingPx = horizontalSpacing.roundToPx()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val vSpacingPx = verticalSpacing.roundToPx()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 第一步：测量所有子节点（使用无限宽度约束，让子节点报告自然尺寸）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val placeables = measurables.map { measurable -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            measurable.measure(Constraints(maxWidth = constraints.maxWidth))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 第二步：计算行信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var currentX = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var currentY = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var rowHeight = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val positions = mutableListOf&#x3C;Pair&#x3C;Int, Int>>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        placeables.forEach { placeable -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (currentX + placeable.width > constraints.maxWidth &#x26;&#x26; currentX > 0) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                currentX = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                currentY += rowHeight + vSpacingPx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                rowHeight = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            positions.add(currentX to currentY)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            currentX += placeable.width + hSpacingPx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            rowHeight = maxOf(rowHeight, placeable.height)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val totalHeight = currentY + rowHeight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 第三步：摆放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        layout(constraints.maxWidth, totalHeight) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            placeables.forEachIndexed { index, placeable -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val (x, y) = positions[index]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                placeable.place(x, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"subcomposelayout-延迟测量\">SubcomposeLayout：延迟测量</h2><p>某些布局需要根据第一批子节点的测量结果来决定第二批子节点的约束（例如：底部栏高度决定内容区的可用高度）。<code>SubcomposeLayout</code> 允许在布局阶段按需组合子节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun HeaderContentLayout(&#10;    header: @Composable () -&gt; Unit,&#10;    content: @Composable (PaddingValues) -&gt; Unit,&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier&#10;) {&#10;    SubcomposeLayout(modifier = modifier) { constraints -&gt;&#10;        // 先测量 header&#10;        val headerPlaceables = subcompose(&quot;header&quot;, header).map {&#10;            it.measure(constraints)&#10;        }&#10;        val headerHeight = headerPlaceables.maxOfOrNull { it.height } ?: 0&#10;&#10;        // 根据 header 高度计算 content 的约束&#10;        val contentConstraints = constraints.copy(&#10;            maxHeight = constraints.maxHeight - headerHeight&#10;        )&#10;        val contentPlaceables = subcompose(&quot;content&quot;) {&#10;            content(PaddingValues(top = headerHeight.toDp()))&#10;        }.map { it.measure(contentConstraints) }&#10;&#10;        val totalHeight = headerHeight +&#10;            (contentPlaceables.maxOfOrNull { it.height } ?: 0)&#10;&#10;        layout(constraints.maxWidth, totalHeight) {&#10;            headerPlaceables.forEach { it.place(0, 0) }&#10;            contentPlaceables.forEach { it.place(0, headerHeight) }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun HeaderContentLayout(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    header: @Composable () -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    content: @Composable (PaddingValues) -> Unit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SubcomposeLayout(modifier = modifier) { constraints -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 先测量 header</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val headerPlaceables = subcompose(\"header\", header).map {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            it.measure(constraints)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val headerHeight = headerPlaceables.maxOfOrNull { it.height } ?: 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 根据 header 高度计算 content 的约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val contentConstraints = constraints.copy(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            maxHeight = constraints.maxHeight - headerHeight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val contentPlaceables = subcompose(\"content\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            content(PaddingValues(top = headerHeight.toDp()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }.map { it.measure(contentConstraints) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val totalHeight = headerHeight +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            (contentPlaceables.maxOfOrNull { it.height } ?: 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        layout(constraints.maxWidth, totalHeight) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            headerPlaceables.forEach { it.place(0, 0) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentPlaceables.forEach { it.place(0, headerHeight) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"intrinsic-measurements\">Intrinsic Measurements</h2><p>当父布局需要在测量子节点之前了解其&quot;自然尺寸&quot;时（如 <code>height(IntrinsicSize.Min)</code> 让所有子节点使用同一行高），需要实现固有测量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun EqualHeightRow(&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,&#10;    content: @Composable () -&gt; Unit&#10;) {&#10;    Layout(&#10;        content = content,&#10;        modifier = modifier,&#10;        measurePolicy = object : MeasurePolicy {&#10;            override fun MeasureScope.measure(&#10;                measurables: List&lt;Measurable&gt;,&#10;                constraints: Constraints&#10;            ): MeasureResult {&#10;                val itemWidth = constraints.maxWidth / measurables.size&#10;                val itemConstraints = constraints.copy(&#10;                    minWidth = itemWidth, maxWidth = itemWidth&#10;                )&#10;                val placeables = measurables.map { it.measure(itemConstraints) }&#10;                val maxHeight = placeables.maxOf { it.height }&#10;                return layout(constraints.maxWidth, maxHeight) {&#10;                    var x = 0&#10;                    placeables.forEach { placeable -&gt;&#10;                        placeable.place(x, 0)&#10;                        x += itemWidth&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;&#10;            override fun IntrinsicMeasureScope.minIntrinsicHeight(&#10;                measurables: List&lt;IntrinsicMeasurable&gt;,&#10;                width: Int&#10;            ): Int {&#10;                val itemWidth = width / measurables.size&#10;                return measurables.maxOf { it.minIntrinsicHeight(itemWidth) }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun EqualHeightRow(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    content: @Composable () -> Unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Layout(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        content = content,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        measurePolicy = object : MeasurePolicy {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun MeasureScope.measure(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                measurables: List&#x3C;Measurable>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                constraints: Constraints</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ): MeasureResult {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val itemWidth = constraints.maxWidth / measurables.size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val itemConstraints = constraints.copy(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    minWidth = itemWidth, maxWidth = itemWidth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val placeables = measurables.map { it.measure(itemConstraints) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val maxHeight = placeables.maxOf { it.height }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return layout(constraints.maxWidth, maxHeight) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    var x = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    placeables.forEach { placeable -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        placeable.place(x, 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        x += itemWidth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun IntrinsicMeasureScope.minIntrinsicHeight(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                measurables: List&#x3C;IntrinsicMeasurable>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                width: Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ): Int {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val itemWidth = width / measurables.size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return measurables.maxOf { it.minIntrinsicHeight(itemWidth) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"parentdata-与自定义-scope\">ParentData 与自定义 Scope</h2><p>像 <code>ColumnScope.weight()</code> 这样的修饰符通过 ParentData 向父布局传递信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 定义自定义 Scope&#10;interface WeightedRowScope {&#10;    fun Modifier.weight(weight: Float): Modifier&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ParentData 载体&#10;data class WeightedRowData(val weight: Float) : ParentData&#10;&#10;// 在 Layout 内读取 ParentData&#10;Layout(content = content) { measurables, constraints -&gt;&#10;    val totalWeight = measurables.sumOf {&#10;        (it.parentData as? WeightedRowData)?.weight?.toDouble() ?: 1.0&#10;    }.toFloat()&#10;&#10;    val placeables = measurables.map { measurable -&gt;&#10;        val weight = (measurable.parentData as? WeightedRowData)?.weight ?: 1f&#10;        val itemWidth = (constraints.maxWidth * weight / totalWeight).roundToInt()&#10;        measurable.measure(Constraints.fixedWidth(itemWidth))&#10;    }&#10;    // ... 摆放逻辑&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 定义自定义 Scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface WeightedRowScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun Modifier.weight(weight: Float): Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ParentData 载体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class WeightedRowData(val weight: Float) : ParentData</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 Layout 内读取 ParentData</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Layout(content = content) { measurables, constraints -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val totalWeight = measurables.sumOf {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (it.parentData as? WeightedRowData)?.weight?.toDouble() ?: 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }.toFloat()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val placeables = measurables.map { measurable -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val weight = (measurable.parentData as? WeightedRowData)?.weight ?: 1f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val itemWidth = (constraints.maxWidth * weight / totalWeight).roundToInt()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        measurable.measure(Constraints.fixedWidth(itemWidth))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ... 摆放逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"布局动画与-lookaheadscope\">布局动画与 LookaheadScope</h2><p>Compose 1.6+ 引入 <code>LookaheadScope</code>，使布局变化能产生平滑动画——先在 lookahead pass 计算目标位置，再在实际 pass 中插值过渡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun AnimatedFlowRow(items: List&lt;String&gt;) {&#10;    LookaheadScope {&#10;        FlowRow {&#10;            items.forEach { item -&gt;&#10;                Box(&#10;                    Modifier&#10;                        .animateBounds(this@LookaheadScope)&#10;                        .padding(4.dp)&#10;                ) {&#10;                    Chip(text = item)&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AnimatedFlowRow(items: List&#x3C;String>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LookaheadScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        FlowRow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            items.forEach { item -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        .animateBounds(this@LookaheadScope)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        .padding(4.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Chip(text = item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>Layout</code> composable 是自定义布局的入口，实现 <code>MeasurePolicy</code> 的 <code>measure</code> 方法</li>\n<li>单次测量约束保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 布局复杂度，换取&quot;每个子节点只能测量一次&quot;的限制</li>\n<li><code>SubcomposeLayout</code> 突破该限制，允许根据先测量的结果决定后续子节点的组合与约束</li>\n<li>Intrinsic Measurements 让父布局在正式测量前获取子节点的自然尺寸</li>\n<li>ParentData 机制实现 <code>weight</code>、<code>align</code> 等 Scope 限定修饰符</li>\n<li><code>LookaheadScope</code> 为布局变化提供开箱即用的过渡动画能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"lazy-layout-internals\">LazyLayout 内部机制</a>——虚拟化列表如何基于 Layout 协议实现按需组合</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../android-development/jetpack-compose/layout-and-modifiers\">Android 开发基础 · Layout 与 Modifier</a>——Modifier 链的测量/绘制/输入三阶段基础</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/dsl-design\">Kotlin 进阶 · DSL 设计</a>——如何设计类型安全的布局 DSL Scope</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自定义布局","id":"自定义布局"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实现一个 FlowRow 布局","id":"实现一个-flowrow-布局"},{"level":2,"text":"SubcomposeLayout：延迟测量","id":"subcomposelayout-延迟测量"},{"level":2,"text":"Intrinsic Measurements","id":"intrinsic-measurements"},{"level":2,"text":"ParentData 与自定义 Scope","id":"parentdata-与自定义-scope"},{"level":2,"text":"布局动画与 LookaheadScope","id":"布局动画与-lookaheadscope"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Strong Skipping 与稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/foundations/strong-skipping-and-stability"},"next":{"title":"LazyLayout 内部机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/lazy-layout-internals"}}